Special","x":0.065075934145568726,"y":0.27470686718128445,"w":0.34924076080322264,"h":0.03350083752093802},{"x":0.12305984112225772,"h":0.046513405676862463,"w":0.2354421424865723,"text":"Surprise","y":0.30523166922235234},{"h":0.013081394847313965,"y":0.36046511631180811,"x":0.043383944232707528,"w":0.38611713409423831,"text":"What's the worst thing your best friend can say \/"},{"text":"to say \/ saying to you? 'I won a volleyball scholarship","w":0.40130149841308593,"y":0.37645348860226746,"h":0.014668789740583055,"x":0.043383961295987705},{"x":0.041214760475075746,"h":0.014534883163682233,"text":"in Australia and I'm moving away'. Zara '_","y":0.39098837222629834,"w":0.32537960052490233},{"h":0.014673658751163443,"text":"(always \/ be) sporty. While she ?","y":0.40829145743096829,"x":0.041214751623190972,"w":0.25162689208984373},{"y":0.40787618780270574,"text":"_ (win) prizes,","w":0.11310464859008784,"h":0.015642972847125458,"x":0.33607240347478057},{"h":0.013186085363928068,"text":"I was cheering her on or coming last! I was very","x":0.043383961739540559,"w":0.36876354217529295,"y":0.42441860482924998},{"text":"upset but I intended 'do \/ to do \/ doing something","y":0.43886097130216273,"x":0.04338395157676786,"w":0.38394794464111326,"h":0.014656616415410495},{"y":0.45477386901360384,"x":0.043383949150426308,"h":0.01340033540773633,"text":"special before she left.","w":0.17136659622192382},{"h":0.013081394847314076,"y":0.47819767488738951,"text":"Zara loves surprises, so I wanted 'organise \/ organising \/","x":0.043383968214399715,"w":0.40347068786621093},{"w":0.35791755676269532,"h":0.013130088148005203,"x":0.043383958386548155,"y":0.49273255834669194,"text":"to organise a surprise leaving party. I told a few"},{"w":0.40347068786621099,"text":"friends but warned 'them not to tell \/ not to tell them \/","y":0.50711892788520052,"x":0.043383955271522404,"h":0.01340033500837523},{"x":0.043383947611751204,"text":"them not telling anyone.","w":0.175704994201660